      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A seasonal creek snakes through the canyon, creating riparian zones of cottonwood and willow amid the surrounding chaparral.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
