      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Before settlers, the Pinal Apache and Yavapai bands roamed the canyon, hunting and gathering across its varied elevations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        6,
        27,
