      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/icehouse_canyon_arizona",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Mule deer, black bears, and mountain lions roam the canyon, while owls and other birds call its forests home.",
